<title>USA: Deutsche Morgan lowers Coleman rating.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Morgan lowers Coleman rating.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell C. J. Lawrence analyst Peter Barry lowers rating on Coleman Co Inc to hold from buy, citing concern over weak Japanese sales.</p>
<p>- Lowers 1997 EPS estimate to $1.08 from $1.27</p>
<p>- Expects recent Camping Gaz acquisition to be only &quot;modestly&quot; accretive to 1997 earnings, better returns in 1998.</p>
</text>
